<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent gangs are seizing thousands of homes in Mexico City while a Gulf Cartel leader's arrest has sparked riots in northern Mexico and a mayor who opposed cartels was assassinated, prompting his son’s detention and a brief halt of trucker protests that later resumed after talks with authorities. Federal agents have indicted engineer Luis Manuel Hernandez Victoria for building a 1,900‑foot cross-border drug tunnel and have brought terrorism charges against him, and a major cross-border drug operation was uncovered in San Diego County. A 7‑year-year-old American girl was among six dead in cartel violence in Matamoros. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQWS1CNmxOSjRTN19MSjRSNUFBUWdtV2hLUlJBd21jd0RwMG5mTjZyc3JDT3dmUG5PNWVVTUhYbWotQVFEWTFjd3hvS3haOTdObjctT1ZaSXRVMmttejY0SE5PTFFKaDBIcG9VbWRYR2c4SnZkNlVZUGZtNmxHcDAtSTc3a0E5MWdWWDBYdklEZ1RqMjRnbXZoempKLTBCYUlHRUFWZWdKRTFxV1BPejFmSlZLdW83RUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindustan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Imperial Valley Press Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxPRHZmbFdoNTc3aWdtSFh2eDlpWWZQdHhaWmpxaUdWMmZtdzNUWFFsd21oLUI5NUc0NnNsckRoQl9qLVFQOUtvOWNMX29sLWNxRW13b01YREpqbFNMRzBwQWFmSC1Pbmo0cEU2UHBScklyUzUxaWlRRTlzRnRmUXE0LWUwLXhBZVhqdWFJNUwtcl9lYW1NWGQ4cHA1WFoyNkFPSmZlcGZMcnVYM1lvV3BB?oc=5&quot;&gt;KABB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;cbs8.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;FOX 5 San Diego &amp;amp; KUSI News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot